  "about": {
    "description": "wBTBTx is the ERC-4626 wrapped version of BTBTx (Bit Digital xStock). It wraps BTBTx into a standardized vault-share token to enable DeFi composability such as use as collateral in lending markets, automated strategies, and other yield protocols. Each wBTBTx represents a share claim on deposited BTBTx. Underlying real-world exposure, redemption mechanics, and reference price tracking are inherited from the underlying BTBTx xStock issued by Backed. The wrapper does not rebase, so its share-to-underlying ratio grows with the xStocks multiplier, making it a total-return tracker rather than a price-parity tracker.",
